mcf.add_edge(x * T + j, y * T + j + 1, 1, cur * d + c);\n                mcf.add_edge(y * T + j, x * T + j + 1, 1, cur * d + c);\n                cur += 2;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n\n    auto res = mcf.run(N, N + 1);\n    assert(res.first == k);\n    cout << res.second << '\\n';\n\n    return 0;\n}\n</original_code>\n"}], "temp": 0, "sample_size": 1, "logprobs": true, "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"}, "response": {"samples": [{"content": "<translated_code>\nimport java.io.*;\nimport java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    static class Edge {\n        int to, rev;\n        long cap, cost;\n        Edge(int to, int rev, long cap, long cost) {\n            this.to = to;\n            this.rev = rev;\n            this.cap = cap;\n            this.cost = cost;\n        }\n    }\n\n    static class MinCostMaxFlow {\n        int n;\n        ArrayList<ArrayList<Edge>> g;\n        long[] pot, dist;\n        int[] prevv, preve;\n\n        MinCostMaxFlow(int n) {\n            this.n = n;\n            g = new ArrayList<>(n);\n            for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) g.add(new ArrayList<>());\n            pot = new long[n];\n            dist = new long[n];\n            prevv = new int[n];\n            preve = new int[n];\n        }\n\n        void addEdge(int v, int u, long cap, long cost) {\n            g.get(v).add(new Edge(u, g.get(u).size(), cap, cost));\n            g.get(u).add(new Edge(v, g.get(v).size() - 1, 0, -cost));\n        }\n\n        long[] run(int s, int t) {\n            long flow = 0, totalCost = 0;\n            final long INF = Long.MAX_VALUE / 2;\n\n            while (true) {\n                Arrays.fill(dist, INF);\n                PriorityQueue<long[]> pq = new PriorityQueue<>(Comparator.comparingLong(a -> a[0]));\n                dist[s] = 0;\n                pq.offer(new long[]{0, s});\n\n                while (!pq.isEmpty()) {\n                    long[] cur = pq.poll();\n                    long d = cur[0];\n                    int v = (int) cur[1];\n                    if (d != dist[v]) continue;\n\n                    for (int i = 0; i < g.get(v).size(); i++) {\n                        Edge e = g.get(v).get(i);\n                        if (e.cap == 0) continue;\n                        long nd = d + e.cost + pot[v] - pot[e.to];\n                        if (nd < dist[e.to]) {\n                            dist[e.to] = nd;\n                            prevv[e.to] = v;\n                            preve[e.to] = i;\n                            pq.offer(new long[]{nd, e.to});\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n\n                if (dist[t] == INF) break;\n\n                for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n                    if (dist[i] < INF) pot[i] += dist[i];\n                }\n\n                long add = INF;\n                for (int v = t; v != s; v = prevv[v]) {\n                    add = Math.min(add, g.get(prevv[v]).get(preve[v]).cap);\n                }\n\n                flow += add;\n                for (int v = t; v != s; v = prevv[v]) {\n                    Edge e = g.get(prevv[v]).get(preve[v]);\n                    e.cap -= add;\n                    g.get(v).get(e.rev).cap += add;\n                    totalCost += add * e.cost;\n                }\n            }\n            return new long[]{flow, totalCost};\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n        StringTokenizer st = new StringTokenizer(br.readLine());\n        int n = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        int m = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        int k = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        int c = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        int d = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n\n        final int T = 500;\n        int N = n * T;\n        MinCostMaxFlow mcf = new MinCostMaxFlow(N + 2);\n\n        // stay edges\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            for (int j = 0; j < T - 1; j++) {\n                mcf.addEdge(i * T + j, i * T + j + 1, Long.MAX_VALUE / 2, c);\n            }\n        }\n\n        // sink edges\n        for (int i = 0; i < T; i++) {\n            mcf.addEdge(i, N + 1, Long.MAX_VALUE / 2, 0);\n        }\n\n        // source to start positions\n        st = new StringTokenizer(br.readLine());\n        for (int i = 0; i < k; i++) {\n            int x = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken()) - 1;\n            mcf.addEdge(N, x * T, 1, 0);\n        }\n\n        // road edges\n        for (int i = 0; i < m; i++) {\n            st = new StringTokenizer(br.readLine());\n            int x = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken()) - 1;\n            int y = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken()) - 1;\n            for (int j = 0; j < T - 1; j++) {\n                int cur = 1;\n                for (int z = 0; z < k; z++) {\n                    mcf.addEdge(x * T + j, y * T + j + 1, 1, (long) cur * d + c);\n                    mcf.addEdge(y * T + j, x * T + j + 1, 1, (long) cur * d + c);\n                    cur += 2;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        long[] res = mcf.run(N, N + 1);\n        // assert res[0] == k;\n        System.out.println(res[1]);\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-7.271740287251305e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -8.821098163025454e-05, -0.0001546025014249608, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.01416344940662384, -0.07890946418046951, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -5.8530047681415454e-05, -0.0019526478135958314, 0.0, -7.73638384998776e-05, -0.03806402161717415, -0.0007116645574569702, -0.007251135539263487, -0.475014328956604, -0.023309968411922455, -7.152555099310121e-07, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -0.00015853578224778175, 0.0, -1.1920922133867862e-06, 0.0, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -3.5523738915799186e-05, 0.0, -0.03810567781329155, -4.637133679352701e-05, -0.00026127262390218675, -1.9073468138230965e-06, -0.04858846589922905, -3.6954811548639555e-06, -1.19209